                        <div class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 bg-white border-4 border-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-black mb-6 sm:mb-8 shadow-xl shadow-brand-900/5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-brand-500 group-hover:bg-brand-50 transition-all duration-300 transform rotate-3 group-hover:rotate-0">
                            1
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4">Du ringer vår vakttelefon</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-light">Forklar problemet kort. Vi gir deg umiddelbare råd (som å stenge hovedkranen) mens vi setter oss i bilen.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Step 2 -->
                    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center group">
                        <div class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 bg-brand-600 border-4 border-white text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-black mb-6 sm:mb-8 shadow-2xl shadow-brand-600/30 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-brand-500 transition-all duration-300 transform -rotate-3 group-hover:rotate-0">
                            2
